27", "author_id": "5587627062", "id": "18087577792975938", "text": "@elias.gzzhbl", "timestamp": 1765223542, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "gonzalosanchezcane", "author_id": "8239317664", "id": "18062062415635783", "text": "Error", "timestamp": 1765204169, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "icyberpublicidad", "author_id": "11340648649", "id": "18089221765779205", "text": "El sabor jamás será el mismo 😂 un negocio debe manejar la trilogía del éxito, si no sabes cuál es, pregúntame al privado!", "timestamp": 1765046818, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "javierlerzundi", "author_id": "1584457260", "id": "18107536318626666", "text": "👏👏🙌🙌", "timestamp": 1764495315, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jeison.83", "author_id": "21705201915", "id": "17973122015808568", "text": "Eso también depende del entorno, porque no ponen iglesias o  un Mac donals en un barrio popular, el estudio de mercado también es importante.", "timestamp": 1764118724, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "julietarumi", "author_id": "2670160687", "id": "17922224163050095", "text": "👏👏", "timestamp": 1763783795, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "aquino.arcenio", "author_id": "33533719384", "id": "17900528565306121", "text": "👍👍", "timestamp": 1763768551, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mariamariastyle", "author_id": "1395339623", "id": "18152319895411058", "text": "Maravilloso MARAVILLOSO HERMOSO", "timestamp": 1763668340, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "nubelandiapark1", "author_id": "73320887947", "id": "18096539767843355", "text": "🙌 exacto", "timestamp": 1763227654, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "abimelecquinterogarcia", "author_id": "3220027795", "id": "18070451606347588", "text": "Déjame decirte que, no sabes nada de cafe, el recipiente queda en segundo lugar, el café tiene un sabor exclusivo que cada persona identifica y si no detecta ese gusto, aunque lo sirvas en una taza elegante, la persona jamás se lo tomara, simplemente porque no pruebas el sabor que le causa placer a su paladar y no hablo tanto de café ☺️", "timestamp": 1762737015, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mimoliendacafe.origen", "author_id": "70651854366", "id": "17989748342730974", "text": "El Café es, buscado por su Sabor auténtico y se enamora de los ojos 😍 que le atienden...", "timestamp": 1762698111, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "elmaya_82", "author_id": "50699473564", "id": "17968086779971820", "text": "Bien esa es la diferencia", "timestamp": 1762229876, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jesus_espinozaroca", "author_id": "2956760128", "id": "18066530027609039", "text": "👏", "timestamp": 1761946337, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DPfl-vxDX_-/", "webpage_url_basename": "DPfl-vxDX_-", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/560427256_17862995250480555_7146160089139057703_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=MzczNzg3MzI1NTM1ODEwMzU1MA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=GhwDsb2E8vIQ7kNvwECKobr&_nc_oc=AdovFSKSPBkNbcGwaffQwcvQE4CFB2DMiC8Qjg54OKmcDgJCTha23YUjCVuRxSf3Mms&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=uvqpCmXXCaoxdZJgSoTjaw&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQI78q0jaWR-8-TChFcr75cFhONFVI_2n2MvgKYYPva3EA&oe=6AA52C2F", "display_id": "DPfl-vxDX_-", "fulltitle": "Video by vent.asilenciosa", "upload_date": "20251007", "epoch": 1788827066, "format": "dash-1543257673365063v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-1499473861340060a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-1543257673365063v+dash-1499473861340060a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 2045.086, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 1976.086, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 69.0, "asr": 44100, "_type": "video", "_version":